{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/Banner_For_Storepage_Story.png?t=1740174474\" /><strong>A dark and forgotten secret lies hidden within the enchanting realm of Tynedale, waiting to be unveiled. Join Geordie on an epic quest to achieve what his grandfather could not: to navigate treacherous dungeons, vanquish formidable bosses, and unearth the sinister truth lurking in the shadows.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/D3_Switch_50percent.gif?t=1740174474\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/Banner_For_Storepage_Gameplay.png?t=1740174474\" /><strong>The Legends of Tynedale</strong> beckons you to immerse yourself in a stunning pixel art world, brimming with adventure and mystery.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlock a Vast World:</strong> Journey through the vibrant and diverse landscapes of Tynedale, each area filled with challenges and secrets begging to be discovered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Master Intricate Dungeons:</strong> Dive into increasingly complex puzzle-box and lock &amp; key dungeons, where wit and strategy are your greatest allies against cunning traps and obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Epic Battles Await:</strong> Engage in thrilling combat against a myriad of monsters and colossal bosses, each encounter more exhilarating than the last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unravel Hidden Mysteries:</strong> Delve deep into the lore of Tynedale as you uncover secrets and collect treasures that reveal the land\u2019s dark history.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Forge Powerful Weapons and Tools:</strong> Unlock and master an array of formidable weapons and ingenious tools that will enhance your abilities and open new pathways through the enigmatic world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a quest like no other in <strong>The Legends of Tynedale</strong>, where every discovery brings you closer to unravelling the ultimate mystery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/Fire_Ring_7_Loop_60percent_compressed.gif?t=1740174474\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1417590/extras/ezgif.com-gif-maker__1__reeat_7_and_60_percent.gif?t=1740174474\" /></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ashington Mines Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1417590/1540383089b54e34a358f429f67203ca19389bf7.jpg"},{"name":"Catacombs Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1417590/9260a128c0325a7066019aafb8a33f4ea71eda59.jpg"},{"name":"Spindleston Heugh Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1417590/8e3cb2751526a0e2b0dd02a0ca2492a5566d353e.jpg"},{"name":"Feel the Love","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1417590/e43c3d0ff632ff6890c9fe49540d2ab759bc918c.jpg"},{"name":"Who was that guy?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1417590/420640bad2ddf7c66ae4e5cc677f1268966425d8.jpg"},{"name":"Unlocked the Dreadnought","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1417590/d6a449ca14b3eea9d345e203f757c62f164f4241.jpg"},{"name":"Opened Pandora's Box","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1417590/9b25bee2aa04acbee88c0fe81909cd4a12afa15c.jpg"},{"name":"Map Transla